OL,3,GNEWSAWinner crowned at World Conker
OL,4,AChampionships
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe winner of this year's World Conker
OL,7,FChampionships said she was "ecstatic"
OL,8,Fafter clinching the title.
OL,10,FMore than 250 conker combatants,
OL,11,Fincluding entrants from Japan, Holland
OL,12,Fand Germany, headed to Southwick in
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire for Sunday's event.
OL,15,FFrankie Hooper, 28, from Oundle, won
OL,16,Fthe overall event after beating the
OL,17,Fmen's winner, Simon Griffiths, in a
OL,18,Fnail-biting, nut-shattering showdown.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
