OL,3,GNEWSAWinner crowned at World Conker
OL,4,AChampionships
OL,5,
OL,6,FHooper, now known as Queen Conker,
OL,7,Fsaid: "I am feeling pretty ecstatic...
OL,8,FI came into it this morning for a
OL,9,Fchilled fun day with my friends, and
OL,10,Fnow I am a world champion for the
OL,11,Ffemales. It is amazing."
